    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδάπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>devour</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή με ἔα . . κύνας καταδάψαι Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.339
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες τε καὶ οἰωνοὶ κατέδαψαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.259
				</span></i>
			; of fire, <i>consume</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.2
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
				46.129
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Isaura</span>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδάπτετ᾽ ἀκούοντος φίλον ἦτορ</span>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίεται ἦτορ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.92
			</span></i>.</div>
